; abnf stdio.gltf mutations -- binary wire form IS the mutation's own internally-tagged JSON text
; (see 📝️text/component.ebnf), UTF-8 encoded. OpBinary delegates straight to serde_json; no
; separate binary framing exists.
document = json-text
